        512,
        1637,
        1957,
        1817
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Mayor Lindsay in his memorandum of April 6, 1966 stated that he was certain that \"your administrative and supervisory personnel will benefit greatly by attending the Institute\". He added that, \"Attendance should be considered part of their official duties.\"",
